  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Initially when both are in air, the relative acceleration between them is zero. Therefore, relative position verus-time graph is a straight line.<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">vt</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">vt</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">vt</mi></math><br /><br />Once the first ball reaches the ground, its acceleration becomes zero. Therefore, the relative acceleration is now g and the graph is parabolic.<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">vt</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
